            "question_type": "GAP_FILLING",
            "question_count": 10,
            "content": "<h2><strong>Space Traffic Management</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>A Space Traffic Management system</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; is a concept similar to Air Traffic Control, but for satellites rather than planes.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; would aim to set up legal and <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span> ways of improving safety.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; does not actually exist at present.</p>\n<p><strong>Problems in developing effective Space Traffic Management</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; Satellites are now quite <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span> and therefore more widespread (e.g. there are constellations made up of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span> of satellites).</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; At present, satellites are not required to transmit information to help with their <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span> .</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; There are few systems for <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span> satellites.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; Small pieces of debris may be difficult to identify.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; Operators may be unwilling to share details of satellites used for <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span> or commercial reasons.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; It may be hard to collect details of the object&rsquo;s <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span> at a given time.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; Scientists can only make a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span> about where the satellite will go.</p>\n<p><strong>Solutions</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; Common standards should be agreed on for the presentation of information.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; The information should be combined in one <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span> .</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; A coordinated system must be designed to create <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span> in its users.</p>",
